Your document describes a conversation dated February 12, 2025, in which I =
discussed withdrawing my job application. I applied for that job on the nig=
ht of February 12. I did not withdraw it until February 16. A conversation =
about my withdrawal could not have
 happened on the day I applied. The date is false. And the rest of your sto=
ry depends on it.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
